# Production build only (read by `vite build`, NOT by `npm run dev`).
# The deployed frontend and backend are served from ONE origin behind Caddy, which
# reverse-proxies /api/* -> uvicorn (see deploy/Caddyfile). So the built app calls
# the API same-origin under /api — no CORS, one clean domain for Google OAuth.
# Local dev is unaffected: without this var, client.ts defaults to :8000.
VITE_API_URL=/api
